api/generated code is generated from openapi (swagger) json.

to simply regenerate:
 1. save current openapi json file into ./src/api/openapi.v1.json
    curl https://localhost:7086/openapi/v1.json > ./src/api/openapi.v1.json
 2. run the following command from project folder:
    node_modules\.bin\ng-openapi -c ./src/api/ng-openapi-gen.json
    or
    node_modules\.bin\ng-openapi -i ./src/api/openapi.v1.json -o ./src/api/generated

for more info - https://ng-openapi.dev/